WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.763 line:78%
Welcome back, Architect. By now, you've awakened. You've looked honestly at your
life.

00:00:05.813 --> 00:00:07.560 line:78%
And you've made a decision.

00:00:07.610 --> 00:00:12.914 line:78%
Now comes the question that determines whether that decision becomes your reality.

00:00:12.964 --> 00:00:15.293 line:78%
What standards will guide your life?

00:00:15.343 --> 00:00:19.354 line:78%
Our lives rarely rise above the standards we choose to accept.

00:00:19.404 --> 00:00:24.255 line:78%
Extraordinary lives aren't built through occasional moments of inspiration.

00:00:24.305 --> 00:00:28.834 line:78%
They're built through intentional choices made consistently over time.

00:00:28.884 --> 00:00:35.482 line:78%
This chapter invites you to establish the standards that will become the foundation
of your Back Half.

00:00:35.532 --> 00:00:38.572 line:78%
Choose them carefully. Honor them consistently.

00:00:38.622 --> 00:00:43.344 line:78%
And allow them to become the compass that guides every decision you make.

00:00:43.394 --> 00:00:45.870 line:78%
When you're ready... Let's begin Chapter Four.
